# Full Steam Ahead: "Until end of turn, each creature you control gets +2/+2 and gains trample and 'This creature can't be blocked by more than one creature'" (CR 611.2c,
# 702.19, 509.1b). In turn 3 it affects the Grizzly Bears (4/4) and Memnite (3/3) Bot1 controls as it resolves, not Bot2's Savannah Lions (2/1) and not the second Memnite
# cast afterwards (1/1). Bot2 may not put its Memnite and Lions both in front of the Grizzly Bears; its Memnite alone blocks them and the Bears trample over for 3
# (4 damage: 1 lethal to the 1/1), while the Lions block the other Memnite (3/3), which tramples 2 over them (1 lethal to the 2/1). Bot2 20 - 3 - 2 = 15.

